draw((0,1)--(1,1)--(1,2)--(3,2)--(3,1)--(5,1)--(5,2)--(6,2),linewidth(2));
[/asy]

reference_solution:
Consider the top left unit square. There are three different ways an L-shaped piece can cover that square:

[asy]
